      "updated": 1786744317691,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Design a quota management system that tracks and enforces resource usage limits across multiple backend services.\n\n",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Design a quota management system that tracks and enforces resource usage limits across multiple backend services.\n\n",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "4Kp9meegDW3T4-mn3Gxyw",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 303,
      "y": 154.5,
      "width": 684.139404296875,
      "height": 225,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "a4",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 36644400,
      "version": 376,
      "versionNonce": 655264816,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1786744312959,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Functional Requirement\n\n1) User quota: can ask to use space for user/team\n(user belong to team)\n2) Free up quota: service can give space back when user delete a files\n3) Cancel request: service can cancel request if upload fails\n4) Check usage: users can see how much space they have use\n\n-- assume 1 global limit per user",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Functional Requirement\n\n1) User quota: can ask to use space for user/team\n(user belong to team)\n2) Free up quota: service can give space back when user delete a files\n3) Cancel request: service can cancel request if upload fails\n4) Check usage: users can see how much space they have use\n\n-- assume 1 global limit per user",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
