      "text": "- Quota dashboard overview (total, usage, remaining, WoW usage, top consumers)\n- Usage explorer (by user, by team, by resourceType, by project)\n- Manage quota: create/edit/delet quota for user, teams, tenants\n- Receive Alerts: notify user, admin when usage crosses thresholds",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "- Quota dashboard overview (total, usage, remaining, WoW usage, top consumers)\n- Usage explorer (by user, by team, by resourceType, by project)\n- Manage quota: create/edit/delet quota for user, teams, tenants\n- Receive Alerts: notify user, admin when usage crosses thresholds",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
