    {
      "id": "nw3ighfgoN0Y-iMj27H9X",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 1231.82784610185,
      "y": 1868.9772310887997,
      "width": 842.8394775390625,
      "height": 125,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "b0A",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 505103920,
      "version": 240,
      "versionNonce": 64827600,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1786749275175,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "- single DB cannot handle ~10k of updates per second if require\n- Sharding and split by user_id or cluster_id\n- DB is SoT, cache is NOT necessary here (even lead to issue:\nTwo servers see \"10 GB free\" in the cache. Both allow an upload. Overdraft happens.)\n",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "- single DB cannot handle ~10k of updates per second if require\n- Sharding and split by user_id or cluster_id\n- DB is SoT, cache is NOT necessary here (even lead to issue:\nTwo servers see \"10 GB free\" in the cache. Both allow an upload. Overdraft happens.)\n",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "fDhwiU11S_T-RgOYtc8qM",
