      "versionNonce": 280008671,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1787331664737,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "1. Quota policies are immutable; updates create a new version.\n2. Maintain an atomic active-version pointer and support scheduled activation.\n3. Usage survives policy changes; don’t version/reset usage with configuration.\n4. Record the policy version on every quota decision for audit/debugging.\n5. Versioning handles configuration correctness; atomic check-and-reserve handles concurrency correctness.",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "1. Quota policies are immutable; updates create a new version.\n2. Maintain an atomic active-version pointer and support scheduled activation.\n3. Usage survives policy changes; don’t version/reset usage with configuration.\n4. Record the policy version on every quota decision for audit/debugging.\n5. Versioning handles configuration correctness; atomic check-and-reserve handles concurrency correctness.",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
